1
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,919
Take the high ground.

2
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,520
Copy.

3
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:38,560
Who knew that just to destroy my factory,

4
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:41,480
you'd willingly let me torture you?

5
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,319
Don't forget, though—

6
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:46,480
you're addicted now.

7
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,439
You're so clear-headed...

8
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,079
Did you take my antidote?

9
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,040
You guessed right.

10
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:55,319
I took the antidote you developed.

11
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,879
It cleared my mind instantly,

12
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:00,839
and gave me one desperate craving:

13
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,279
to bring you down once and for all.

14
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,279
Don't be naive.

15
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:08,120
The antidote only keeps you lucid for a day.

16
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,759
One day is more than enough.

17
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,959
I was too merciful before.

18
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:18,360
Now, I won't even give you a second.

19
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,040
Shoot him!

20
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:26,920
I'm going to kill you!

21
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:36,519
Raymond, cover me!

22
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,839
Raymond, what are you doing?

23
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:02,040
I'm hit!

24
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,720
Damn bastards!

25
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,519
Captain!

26
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,480
Captain!

27
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:43,079
Captain! Captain!

28
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:43,959
Captain!

29
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:48,079
What's the fuss? I'm not dead.

30
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,120
You're not hurt?

31
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:50,079
Nope.

32
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:53,680
Felt young today, had a real blast.

33
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,399
You scared me half to death.

34
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,279
Let's go. Come on.

35
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,720
We're heading out.

36
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,920
Take care.

37
00:07:22,279 --> 00:07:23,079
Stay safe.

38
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,279
You take care too.

39
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,519
We're off, then.

40
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,040
Go on.

41
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,480
Let's go, Anda.

42
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,879
What's on your mind?

43
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:58,680
I don't know either.

44
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:01,240
I just feel like something's about to happen.

45
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:04,120
My heart was racing last night.

46
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,199
In a place like this,

47
00:08:06,199 --> 00:08:07,920
so many things happen every day.

48
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,680
Still, for something to get your heart racing,

49
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:12,439
it must be...

50
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,360
Wei Tian,

51
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:33,480
tell me what happened.

52
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,000
With so many of you,

53
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,679
how could you let two people get away?

54
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:37,480
Those two were really tough.

55
00:08:37,639 --> 00:08:39,279
They had plenty of weapons in their vehicle, too.

56
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,279
Do you have photos from the scene? Let me see.

57
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:43,919
Yes.

58
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:59,279
Zhong'an's men.

59
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,159
Zhong'an's men.

60
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,879
Why is it always them?

61
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,559
Don't you think

62
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:05,759
we should do something about it?

63
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,519
These guys are way out of line.

64
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:09,720
Hades.

65
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:12,080
I told you to come discuss this earlier.

66
00:09:12,279 --> 00:09:14,080
Why did you just get here?

67
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,879
My factory was destroyed.

68
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,080
I'm going to make them pay for it.

69
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,360
I won't show any mercy this time.

70
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:26,360
Whatever happened before,

71
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,679
set aside your personal grudge for now.

72
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:30,720
We have more important things to do.

73
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,480
Give your orders.

74
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,519
Hades.

75
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,559
Execute my orders immediately.

76
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,200
Take your men and seize the port right now.

77
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:43,360
I just received word

78
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,679
that José Limón opened the port.

79
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:47,360
The port is crucial to us.

80
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,639
Taking it will give us

81
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:52,039
more leverage at the negotiating table.

82
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:53,960
We're running out of time.

83
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,679
I'll assign you a unit.

84
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:59,960
You must reach the port as fast as possible

85
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:01,320
and take control of it.

86
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,399
Also, remember this:

87
00:10:02,399 --> 00:10:05,159
Do not cause any damage to the port,

88
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:08,120
and do not harm any innocent civilians.

89
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,679
Especially the Chinese.

90
00:10:09,679 --> 00:10:11,480
We can't afford to offend them right now.

91
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,279
Do you understand what I'm saying?

92
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,279
I hear you. Don't worry.

93
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,720
Mark my words.

94
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:19,240
Don't play any tricks on me.

95
00:10:19,679 --> 00:10:20,679
Of course.

96
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,960
I'll send men over right away.

97
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:24,559
Good.

98
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:32,080
Hades' drug factory has been destroyed.

99
00:10:33,519 --> 00:10:35,080
In Antilocaris,

100
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,840
all his economic lifelines

101
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,639
have been completely cut off.

102
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,919
So

103
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,120
staying here

104
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:42,759
holds no value for him anymore.

105
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:47,080
How are you feeling?

106
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,679
Do you need to see a doctor?

107
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:51,279
I'm fine, don't worry.

108
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:56,080
Helen, how are things on your end?

109
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,519
This morning,

110
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:59,639
Shen Yu and Xiao Bei escorted the first batch

111
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:01,480
of refugees leaving Antilocaris

112
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,480
to the airport.

113
00:11:02,879 --> 00:11:04,080
But there's a big problem now.

114
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:06,360
The airport's capacity is limited.

115
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:07,559
Aside from Plato,

116
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:09,360
there are many refugee sites in the city.

117
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:11,240
In total,

118
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,080
all the Chinese nationals needing to return

119
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,720
could number several thousand.

120
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,720
If only we had ships.

121
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,360
Yeah.

122
00:11:18,679 --> 00:11:20,679
But the problem is that terrorists

123
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:22,120
also have their eyes on that place.

124
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:26,120
King José Limón is a good king.

125
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,759
Hopefully he can

126
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,919
stabilize the situation as soon as possible.

127
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:35,320
Helen.

128
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:36,879
You're all here.

129
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:37,840
Consul Wu.

130
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,320
And these two are...

131
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:40,720
Let me introduce them.

132
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,279
This is Mr. Wei Tian,

133
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,480
and Captain Qu Shengli.

134
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,279
Hello, Consul Wu.

135
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:46,360
Hello.

136
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:47,840
Hello.

137
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,759
Hello.

138
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,519
Consul Wu, please have a seat.

139
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,120
Consul Wu,

140
00:11:54,759 --> 00:11:56,279
has something happened?

141
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,679
King José Limón

142
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:00,759
has begun leading troops in a major counteroffensive.

143
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:02,240
That's great!

144
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,440
And he also announced

145
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,519
the lifting of the blockade on the port.

146
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:09,320
At the same time, he sent troops

147
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:12,159
to reinforce the port's security.

148
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:17,039
As long as the port is secure,

149
00:12:17,679 --> 00:12:20,519
the mass evacuation of nationals will be resolved.

150
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:23,159
But my concern is that

151
00:12:23,279 --> 00:12:26,000
the current situation in Antilocaris

152
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,120
is still not very stable.

153
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,519
From here to the port,

154
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:31,879
security along the way remains a risk.

155
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:33,240
It's fine, don't worry.

156
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:35,039
Shen Yu and I have been to the port before.

157
00:12:35,279 --> 00:12:36,080
I know the route.

158
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,080
I'll lead the way this time,

159
00:12:37,279 --> 00:12:39,919
and I can protect our fellow citizens as well.

160
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,080
By the way, Consul Wu,

161
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:45,080
when will the evacuation of nationals at the port begin?

162
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:47,039
All of us can help out.

163
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:48,320
Great.

164
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:51,360
It's wonderful having you all here.

165
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,519
As for this matter,

166
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:54,120
I'll arrange it as soon as I get back.

167
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,919
However, I heard

168
00:12:56,399 --> 00:12:58,559
Walter has sent Hades

169
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:00,120
to seize the port.

170
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,080
You must be careful.

171
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,879
All right, then.

172
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,720
You keep chatting, I'll go make arrangements.

173
00:13:07,279 --> 00:13:08,080
Okay.

174
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,039
Let's go.

175
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,639
That king has amassed a massive army

176
00:13:25,639 --> 00:13:27,039
to launch a major counteroffensive.

177
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:27,840
Right.

178
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,440
I'm afraid our situation in Supedo

179
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,759
is about to get much tougher.

180
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:32,720
Wei Tian already destroyed the factory,

181
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:34,759
but the higher-ups don't want to stop yet.

182
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:37,840
We need to cause even greater chaos.

183
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,960
But the military is watching us closely,

184
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,679
and our firepower is limited.

185
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:44,440
Also, I just got word.

186
00:13:44,639 --> 00:13:45,879
King José Limón

187
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,080
and Walter might reach

188
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,639
a temporary ceasefire agreement.

189
00:13:48,759 --> 00:13:50,440
Both sides are negotiating right now.

190
00:13:50,919 --> 00:13:51,720
Damn it.

191
00:13:52,559 --> 00:13:55,080
Looks like this riot will end soon.

192
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,120
No way.

193
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,200
We can't leave

194
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,639
Antilocaris in disgrace.

195
00:13:59,639 --> 00:14:01,080
They must pay the price.

196
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,919
What's your plan?

197
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,720
I'm going to blow up that port.

198
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:07,919
Consul Wu,

199
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,080
we're ready.

200
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,120
We can move out anytime.

201
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,440
That's wonderful.

202
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:14,759
I'll finally see our compatriots

203
00:14:14,919 --> 00:14:17,240
embark on their journey home.

204
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,120
Rest assured, Consul Wu.

205
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,720
I know the road to the port well.

206
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,480
I will ensure our compatriots

207
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,720
all arrive safely.

208
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,919
Good.

209
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,519
With you here, I'm at ease.

210
00:14:28,039 --> 00:14:30,159
Our compatriots are at ease too.

211
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,639
I'll await your good news.

212
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,240
Well, everyone,

213
00:14:39,559 --> 00:14:40,360
take care.

214
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,120
Take care.

215
00:14:42,679 --> 00:14:44,639
Everyone, follow me.

216
00:14:45,919 --> 00:14:46,720
Let's go.

217
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,240
Wei Tian.

218
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:58,480
Still have the badges I gave you earlier?

219
00:15:03,679 --> 00:15:04,480
It's fine.

220
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,960
I made new ones for everyone.

221
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:07,919
One for each of you.

222
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,600
I know if Sister Rosie and Sha Lan saw this,

223
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,759
they'd be happy for us.

224
00:15:24,879 --> 00:15:25,679
Wei Tian.

225
00:15:27,639 --> 00:15:29,360
It's been a while since we worked together.

226
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,159
I believe

227
00:15:32,559 --> 00:15:34,720
Rosie and Sha Lan's spirits in heaven

228
00:15:35,759 --> 00:15:36,919
will watch over us.

229
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,559
It looks like government forces

230
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:55,080
have already seized the port.

231
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,639
We can't launch a surprise attack now.

232
00:15:58,159 --> 00:15:59,279
We can storm it.

233
00:15:59,279 --> 00:16:00,240
We can't storm it.

234
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,200
Walter ordered us

235
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,519
not to damage the facilities.

236
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,279
You're all just cowards!

237
00:16:04,279 --> 00:16:05,720
No wonder you keep losing!

238
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:07,039
If you're so tough, go do it yourself.

239
00:16:07,039 --> 00:16:08,039
You're not our commander.

240
00:16:08,039 --> 00:16:09,039
We're pulling out.

241
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,120
Sorry, routine check.

242
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:49,840
Wei Tian.

243
00:16:50,639 --> 00:16:52,279
And Helen from Zhong'an...

244
00:16:53,679 --> 00:16:55,080
Qu Shengli is here too.

245
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:00,519
Cam.

246
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:02,840
Long time no see.

247
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,279
What brings you here?

248
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,960
We're here to escort our fellow citizens

249
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,960
to board the ship back home.

250
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,720
There's something you need to know.

251
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,720
Go ahead.

252
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:12,839
Walter has sent

253
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,680
a highly dangerous crime boss

254
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,960
to seize the port.

255
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,240
His name is Hades.

256
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,559
Be extremely careful.

257
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:20,720
We will. Thank you.

258
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,680
Take care.

259
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:40,440
Sir, no suspicious items or personnel found.

260
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,000
Let them through.

261
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,359
Looks like they're getting ready...

262
00:17:52,359 --> 00:17:53,920
...to evacuate nationals through the port.

263
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,559
Perfect.

264
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,319
We can wipe them all out at once.

265
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:58,680
Fight them yourself if you want.

266
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,279
I'm reporting to Walter. Let's go.

267
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,440
Everyone, keep up!

268
00:18:39,559 --> 00:18:40,480
Stay close, everyone!

269
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,240
Keep moving!

270
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:50,680
Okay.

271
00:18:50,839 --> 00:18:52,119
Everyone, stop and take a rest.

272
00:18:52,319 --> 00:18:53,759
Alright, rest in place.

273
00:18:59,119 --> 00:18:59,920
Sit down, sit down.

274
00:19:00,319 --> 00:19:01,119
Take a seat.

275
00:19:03,799 --> 00:19:05,079
They've entered the port.

276
00:19:05,319 --> 00:19:06,839
Quick, deploy the drone!

277
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,160
Yes, sir.

278
00:19:20,519 --> 00:19:21,759
It's Hades' drone.

279
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,240
I'll track the signal.

280
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:24,240
Protect the refugees!

281
00:19:24,359 --> 00:19:25,160
Fall back!

282
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,079
Everyone, fall back!

283
00:19:26,079 --> 00:19:26,799
Move!

284
00:19:26,799 --> 00:19:27,920
Evacuate quickly!

285
00:19:28,079 --> 00:19:29,640
Go, go, go, move!

286
00:19:29,799 --> 00:19:31,039
Hurry, move!

287
00:19:31,599 --> 00:19:33,039
Go, go, get moving!

288
00:19:33,039 --> 00:19:34,920
Hurry, hurry, move!

289
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:38,799
Hurry!

290
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:42,839
Fire! Fire! Keep firing!

291
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,319
Kill them all!

292
00:19:44,839 --> 00:19:45,720
Quick, quick!

293
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:55,279
Watch out! Careful, move!

294
00:19:55,279 --> 00:19:55,799
Wei Tian!

295
00:19:55,799 --> 00:19:56,640
Come over here!

296
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,960
I've taken control of the drone,

297
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:58,680
and I've already located

298
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,920
its signal transmitter.

299
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:00,599
Where is it?

300
00:20:00,599 --> 00:20:01,839
Right next to this checkpoint.

301
00:20:01,839 --> 00:20:04,480
Boss, the drone control signal...

302
00:20:04,519 --> 00:20:05,559
seems to have dropped.

303
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,960
Boss, we've been spotted!

304
00:20:11,319 --> 00:20:12,119
Follow me!

305
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:54,119
Looks like Hades has already fled.

306
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,279
Where would he go?

307
00:20:56,319 --> 00:20:58,440
I heard a plane for the evacuation of nationals is arriving soon.

308
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:00,519
Is he trying to sneak aboard and flee to China?

309
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:02,119
Helen.

310
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:05,720
Let's head to the airport to meet Xiang Bei.

311
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:07,680
Tell him to be extra careful.

312
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:10,079
Hades might already be at the airport.

313
00:21:10,079 --> 00:21:10,759
Got it.

314
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:25,559
Hades, not only did you attack the port,

315
00:21:25,559 --> 00:21:26,839
but you also killed my men.

316
00:21:26,839 --> 00:21:28,480
Don't think you can keep playing me.

317
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:29,359
Let me tell you this.

318
00:21:29,359 --> 00:21:31,240
I've called a ceasefire with the government forces.

319
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:32,559
From now on,

320
00:21:32,559 --> 00:21:33,880
I have only one objective:

321
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,319
to hunt you down with everything I've got.

322
00:21:35,319 --> 00:21:38,559
I'll make sure you die without a grave!

323
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,680
We have to get out of Antilocaris.

324
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,440
How do we get out?

325
00:21:46,599 --> 00:21:47,759
There's only one way.

326
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,119
Head to the airport immediately.

327
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,039
All set.

328
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,680
Great, thank you so much.

329
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,920
We finally got plane tickets.

330
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,920
All right, thanks. Come on.

331
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:51,200
Xiang Bei.

332
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,839
Wei Tian, you okay?

333
00:22:52,839 --> 00:22:53,599
I'm fine.

334
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,119
Any news?

335
00:22:57,079 --> 00:22:58,279
I've checked all the passengers.

336
00:22:58,279 --> 00:22:59,920
Found no one connected to Hades.

337
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:04,880
The airport is his only way out.

338
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,839
Then how do we find him?

339
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:10,279
Could it be...

340
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:12,720
...he never planned to enter the cabin,

341
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,319
but wanted to create a diversion...

342
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:15,920
...and sneak out through the cargo hold?

343
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,039
Excuse me.

344
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:25,119
Please take us to inspect the cargo hold.

345
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:26,480
All right. This way, please.

346
00:23:26,799 --> 00:23:27,599
Let's go.

347
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,279
Hello, Captain.

348
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,119
Who are you?

349
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:39,759
Where's my co-pilot, Cai?

350
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:43,480
He's under the weather today, resting.

351
00:23:43,480 --> 00:23:44,759
They assigned me to fly with you.

352
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,279
But I've never seen you before.

353
00:23:47,559 --> 00:23:48,839
Didn't the company inform you?

354
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:51,039
I was called in at the last minute, too.

355
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,119
Nothing we could do.

356
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,880
This is a special flight.

357
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:55,200
All right.

358
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:56,759
Looking forward to working with you.

359
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:00,440
What was that noise?

360
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:01,599
Nothing.

361
00:24:01,599 --> 00:24:02,920
Probably just the ground crew.

362
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:03,799
Have a seat.

363
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:10,680
Don't move!

364
00:24:10,839 --> 00:24:11,720
Freeze!

365
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:13,480
Don't move!

366
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:15,799
Freeze!

367
00:24:16,119 --> 00:24:16,920
Hands up!

368
00:24:22,359 --> 00:24:23,519
Move! Hurry up!

369
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:31,039
You were right after all.

370
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,920
They were all hiding in here.

371
00:24:34,559 --> 00:24:37,119
But Hades isn't among them.

372
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:41,599
The plane takes off in 15 minutes.

373
00:24:41,599 --> 00:24:42,759
We have to find him right away.

374
00:25:21,039 --> 00:25:21,880
Any luck?

375
00:25:22,119 --> 00:25:22,920
Nothing.

376
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:25,000
No sign of him.

377
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,680
I've checked every passenger here.

378
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:28,319
There's no way he got on the plane.

379
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:31,839
Even with the best disguise,

380
00:25:32,119 --> 00:25:34,119
Wei Tian and I would spot him right away.

381
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:36,359
But we haven't seen him at all.

382
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,480
Where else

383
00:25:38,119 --> 00:25:39,319
haven't we checked?

384
00:25:41,759 --> 00:25:43,200
The control room in the tower,

385
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:45,440
and the captain's lounge haven't been checked.

386
00:25:48,039 --> 00:25:48,839
Let's go.

387
00:25:48,839 --> 00:25:49,599
Let's move.

388
00:26:12,319 --> 00:26:13,839
That's about it. Let's go.

389
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:15,960
Where are you going?

390
00:26:16,319 --> 00:26:17,440
We still haven't received

391
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,519
the signal from the tower.

392
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,839
If we board and take off now,

393
00:26:20,839 --> 00:26:21,880
the timing should be about right.

394
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:24,119
We still need orders to board.

395
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:25,640
Otherwise, we'd break regulations.

396
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:27,720
Regulations won't feed us.

397
00:26:28,119 --> 00:26:28,920
Let's go.

398
00:26:29,319 --> 00:26:30,119
Stop right there.

399
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:31,720
I'm the captain.

400
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:32,880
Without my order,

401
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:34,720
no one boards this plane.

402
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,119
Captain,

403
00:26:40,119 --> 00:26:41,720
we're here for a security check.

404
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:42,640
Please open the door.

405
00:26:48,319 --> 00:26:49,119
Don't move.

406
00:26:50,319 --> 00:26:51,319
Who are you?

407
00:26:51,799 --> 00:26:53,440
That's none of your business.

408
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:55,359
Just fly the plane when the time comes.

409
00:26:55,599 --> 00:26:56,720
Don't even think about it.

410
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,279
You guys, get in here now.

411
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,319
He... he's hijacking me.

412
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:06,559
Captain,

413
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:08,119
I've got this, Anda.

414
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,519
No. Hey, you, come here a second.

415
00:27:10,559 --> 00:27:11,720
Help... help open the door.

416
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:12,119
Okay.

417
00:27:12,119 --> 00:27:12,799
Thanks.

418
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:16,440
Thank you.

419
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,559
Anda, what is it?

420
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:22,920
He was knocked out.

421
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,720
Nobody move.

422
00:27:29,759 --> 00:27:30,880
Put the gun down.

423
00:27:31,640 --> 00:27:33,880
Put the gun down, down!

424
00:27:36,799 --> 00:27:37,759
Everybody, lower your weapons.

425
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:43,960
Hades, you've got nowhere left to run.

426
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:45,920
Wei Tian, listen to me.

427
00:27:46,599 --> 00:27:48,559
I've got a bomb on me.

428
00:27:49,079 --> 00:27:50,880
If I die or pass out,

429
00:27:51,079 --> 00:27:53,480
the bomb will go off in 30 seconds.

430
00:27:54,359 --> 00:27:55,880
Do you think that in 30 seconds,

431
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:58,160
you can drag me out of the airport?

432
00:28:01,039 --> 00:28:02,119
What do you want?

433
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:04,559
You, come with me.

434
00:28:05,079 --> 00:28:06,319
Take me somewhere.

435
00:28:06,839 --> 00:28:07,880
Once I'm safe,

436
00:28:08,480 --> 00:28:09,960
I'll let her go.

437
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:15,319
Wei Tian.

438
00:28:15,759 --> 00:28:16,559
Wei Tian.

439
00:28:31,119 --> 00:28:33,279
Got it. I've tracked Wei Tian's car.

440
00:28:34,559 --> 00:28:35,359
What's the status?

441
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,880
Where are they heading?

442
00:28:37,079 --> 00:28:38,920
Looks like they're heading for the western cliffs.

443
00:28:39,119 --> 00:28:39,920
The cliffs?

444
00:28:41,079 --> 00:28:43,119
Is Hades trying to escape from there?

445
00:28:43,839 --> 00:28:44,640
We can't let him.

446
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,759
We have to beat them there.

447
00:28:46,799 --> 00:28:47,599
All right.

448
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,640
I'll alert the Captain and Helen,

449
00:28:49,759 --> 00:28:50,839
and have them rendezvous at the cliffs.

450
00:28:50,839 --> 00:28:51,480
Understood.

451
00:28:58,640 --> 00:29:01,960
Hades, you've killed so many people.

452
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:04,039
You'll meet a terrible end!

453
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,480
You're pure evil!

454
00:29:06,519 --> 00:29:07,319
Evil?

455
00:29:07,839 --> 00:29:10,119
This is a world where the strong devour the weak.

456
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:12,279
The evil you speak of...

457
00:29:12,599 --> 00:29:14,559
has long been deeply rooted

458
00:29:14,559 --> 00:29:16,680
in the depths of every human heart.

459
00:29:17,640 --> 00:29:19,000
Haven't you ever stepped on

460
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:20,319
an innocent ant?

461
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:24,880
When you were young, didn't you bully

462
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,480
kids who were smaller than you?

463
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:29,480
It's just that later came a bunch of

464
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,160
self-righteous hypocrites,

465
00:29:32,599 --> 00:29:34,680
claiming to be different from the rest,

466
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:37,920
fabricating lies about the righteous going to heaven

467
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:40,119
and the wicked burning in hell.

468
00:29:41,359 --> 00:29:42,960
Isn't that just another form of selfishness?

469
00:29:44,079 --> 00:29:44,960
Bullshit!

470
00:29:45,119 --> 00:29:46,519
You've killed so many people!

471
00:29:46,559 --> 00:29:48,240
You murdered Wei Tian's wife,

472
00:29:48,480 --> 00:29:50,000
you murdered Sha Lan, Sister Rosie,

473
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:50,920
and Xiang Lai!

474
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:53,519
You're subhuman! You're the selfish one!

475
00:29:54,039 --> 00:29:55,119
Me? Selfish?

476
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:59,680
Let me tell you something:

477
00:30:00,279 --> 00:30:02,559
all humans are cut from the same cloth.

478
00:30:03,119 --> 00:30:04,519
To survive,

479
00:30:04,759 --> 00:30:06,640
to get what they want,

480
00:30:06,799 --> 00:30:08,160
people will stop at nothing,

481
00:30:09,519 --> 00:30:13,039
even taking someone else's life.

482
00:30:16,319 --> 00:30:17,480
Now behave yourself!

483
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:23,880
Anda, don't say any more.

484
00:30:24,359 --> 00:30:25,160
Hades,

485
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:29,119
you need to calm down, too.

486
00:31:03,839 --> 00:31:06,039
Wei Tian, whatever you do, don't move!

487
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:16,799
Don't move!

488
00:31:23,039 --> 00:31:23,839
Hades.

489
00:31:25,759 --> 00:31:26,640
Let her go.

490
00:31:31,519 --> 00:31:32,319
Fine.

491
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:54,039
Anda, get in the car.

492
00:32:01,359 --> 00:32:02,279
What are you doing?

493
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:13,480
Do you have a death wish?

494
00:32:17,839 --> 00:32:18,680
Thank you.

495
00:32:19,599 --> 00:32:20,880
You really let her go?

496
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:07,640
Dad.

497
00:33:08,200 --> 00:33:10,119
Wei Tian.

498
00:34:09,119 --> 00:34:09,920
Wei Tian.

499
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,960
My brother, Sister Rosie,

500
00:34:13,400 --> 00:34:14,880
and Sha Lan all saw it.

501
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:17,320
Let's just turn him over to the police.

502
00:34:29,519 --> 00:34:32,159
Wei Tian, we're together again.

503
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,840
Since we're going to die together,

504
00:34:42,519 --> 00:34:45,079
why not take a few more down with us?

505
00:34:58,840 --> 00:35:00,119
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

506
00:35:00,119 --> 00:35:00,800
Wei Tian!

507
00:35:07,679 --> 00:35:08,519
Wei Tian!

508
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,119
Anda!

509
00:35:15,519 --> 00:35:16,320
Wei Tian!

510
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,639
Hold on, Wei Tian!

511
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:25,360
We can pull you up!

512
00:35:28,639 --> 00:35:30,320
We still have 30 seconds!

513
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:33,760
Let go!

514
00:35:34,119 --> 00:35:34,800
No!

515
00:35:34,800 --> 00:35:35,920
The bomb's about to blow!

516
00:35:36,119 --> 00:35:36,920
No!

517
00:35:39,880 --> 00:35:40,679
Wei Tian!

518
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:43,199
Wei Tian!

519
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:44,920
20 seconds!

520
00:35:48,360 --> 00:35:49,519
There's no time!

521
00:35:50,639 --> 00:35:51,480
Just go!

522
00:35:51,760 --> 00:35:53,079
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

523
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:57,079
Wei Tian, don't!

524
00:35:57,079 --> 00:35:59,880
Captain, Anda, Xiang Bei...

525
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:02,280
Wei Tian, ten seconds!

526
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,039
Helen...

527
00:36:05,119 --> 00:36:05,920
Wei Tian!

528
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:10,119
Take care.

529
00:36:13,519 --> 00:36:14,320
Wei Tian!

530
00:36:15,480 --> 00:36:16,159
Wei Tian!

531
00:36:16,159 --> 00:36:16,840
Wei Tian!

532
00:36:21,079 --> 00:36:22,119
Wei Tian!

533
00:36:22,119 --> 00:36:23,039
Wei Tian!

534
00:36:27,639 --> 00:36:29,679
Wei Tian!

535
00:36:33,199 --> 00:36:34,760
Wei Tian!

536
00:36:35,199 --> 00:36:36,199
Wei Tian!

537
00:36:36,199 --> 00:36:36,880
Anda!

538
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:42,360
Anda!

539
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:46,079
Wei Tian, no!

540
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,360
Wei Tian!

541
00:37:12,119 --> 00:37:13,280
Wei Tian.

542
00:37:18,480 --> 00:37:20,960
Wei Tian, whatever happens from now on,

543
00:37:21,239 --> 00:37:22,679
can you please tell me first?

544
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,880
Do you have any idea

545
00:37:24,119 --> 00:37:26,079
how much you mean to me?

546
00:37:26,679 --> 00:37:27,880
I want to ask about someone.

547
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:30,280
He's a Chinese man.

548
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,360
Chinese.

549
00:37:32,559 --> 00:37:34,440
He's incredible in a fight and deadly with guns.

550
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:37,280
Never flinches in the face of danger.

551
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:39,320
You must mean the Silent Protectors.

552
00:37:39,559 --> 00:37:41,480
That's what everyone in this city calls them.

553
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:43,639
They're the hunters of this city,

554
00:37:43,760 --> 00:37:44,880
guarding it.

555
00:37:45,599 --> 00:37:46,679
Our kind...

556
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:48,960
every single one of us crawled out of hell.

557
00:37:54,599 --> 00:37:56,320
Light and darkness must coexist

558
00:37:57,000 --> 00:37:59,760
for the world to stay in balance.

559
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,719
Zhong'an belongs to the light,

560
00:38:02,639 --> 00:38:04,280
and the Silent Protectors are the dark.

561
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:09,679
I know you're here to keep us safe.

562
00:38:11,119 --> 00:38:13,280
Stay calm. Take a deep breath.

563
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:14,760
Don't be afraid.

564
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:16,079
I'm here to save you.

565
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,480
So I'd like to ask,

566
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:30,679
could you take my commission

567
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:31,639
and protect me?

568
00:38:31,639 --> 00:38:34,119
Are you in trouble again?

569
00:38:34,239 --> 00:38:35,199
Would you really just leave me to die?

570
00:38:35,199 --> 00:38:35,719
Stay away from us.

571
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:51,840
You're the only one left in the Silent Protectors now.

572
00:38:52,639 --> 00:38:53,920
Even if I'm all alone,

573
00:38:54,039 --> 00:38:56,440
I'll give it everything I've got to do this right.

574
00:38:56,679 --> 00:38:58,079
Only a true warrior

575
00:38:58,599 --> 00:39:00,119
deserves this medal.

576
00:39:00,119 --> 00:39:01,559
So you think I'm brave,

577
00:39:01,639 --> 00:39:03,119
just like a warrior?

578
00:39:03,440 --> 00:39:05,519
Xiang Lai, Zhong'an Group Overseas Security Officer,

579
00:39:05,519 --> 00:39:06,280
reporting for duty!

580
00:39:06,280 --> 00:39:07,960
Did you hear about the new mission?

581
00:39:08,199 --> 00:39:10,280
You're heading to Antilocaris in Africa.

582
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:13,119
Anda, head to our post in Antilocaris

583
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:14,679
to take charge of operations there.

584
00:39:14,679 --> 00:39:15,840
I also hope

585
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:17,480
you'll be able to

586
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,960
make your mark in Africa.

587
00:39:25,679 --> 00:39:27,280
Whenever danger strikes here,

588
00:39:27,519 --> 00:39:28,760
as long as you're by my side,

589
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:30,360
I feel completely safe.

590
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,519
We at Zhong'an Group

591
00:39:31,679 --> 00:39:34,159
are China's largest overseas security company.

592
00:39:34,239 --> 00:39:35,440
Whenever you're in danger,

593
00:39:35,440 --> 00:39:37,119
we'll swoop down to save you.

594
00:39:39,840 --> 00:39:41,239
In our line of work,

595
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:43,159
you must be as sharp as an eagle

596
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,480
to stop threats before they strike.

597
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:47,559
Yet whenever I see you save people,

598
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,119
you never look afraid.

599
00:39:49,280 --> 00:39:50,280
What I fear most

600
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:51,920
is going on rescue missions.

601
00:39:57,679 --> 00:39:59,440
Don't be afraid, Anda.

602
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:01,159
I'm with you.

603
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:32,719
What's wrong, Anda?

604
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,119
What are you daydreaming about?

605
00:40:36,119 --> 00:40:37,519
Just a month ago,

606
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:41,159
this place was torn apart by war.

607
00:40:41,519 --> 00:40:44,119
Now I'm suddenly overwhelmed with emotion.

608
00:40:46,079 --> 00:40:47,880
Life is short, so live it to the fullest.

609
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:49,880
True warriors, you know,

610
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:52,039
see life for what it truly is,

611
00:40:52,039 --> 00:40:53,280
and love it all the more.

612
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:55,880
They're just enjoying

613
00:40:55,880 --> 00:40:57,119
this hard-won peace.

614
00:41:02,559 --> 00:41:03,440
Wei Tian!

615
00:41:05,159 --> 00:41:05,960
Where are you going?

616
00:41:07,360 --> 00:41:08,159
Wei Tian!

617
00:41:09,119 --> 00:41:09,920
Can I help you?

618
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:13,119
Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.

619
00:41:20,440 --> 00:41:21,239
What is it?

620
00:41:21,519 --> 00:41:23,039
Did seeing a familiar scene

621
00:41:23,039 --> 00:41:24,320
remind you of the past again?

622
00:41:24,400 --> 00:41:25,199
Yeah.

623
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:26,800
In the past,

624
00:41:26,960 --> 00:41:29,280
Wei Tian often shopped on this street,

625
00:41:29,760 --> 00:41:31,039
especially for that doll.

626
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:34,199
Now the Captain has flown far away,

627
00:41:34,199 --> 00:41:35,280
and the others are gone, too.

628
00:41:36,519 --> 00:41:40,079
Yet every time I see a familiar place,

629
00:41:40,519 --> 00:41:41,440
I still think of

630
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:42,840
everyone in the Silent Protectors.

631
00:41:44,280 --> 00:41:46,480
The Silent Protectors are those who guard the light

632
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,679
from within the shadows.

633
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:49,519
They will never truly disappear.

634
00:41:51,280 --> 00:41:52,679
As long as someone needs them,

635
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:54,079
they will always be there.

636
00:41:55,719 --> 00:41:56,519
Let's go.

637
00:42:42,679 --> 00:42:44,480
Since China's reform and opening-up,

638
00:42:45,039 --> 00:42:48,039
along with the continuous growth of the global economy,

639
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:50,559
many Chinese enterprises and individuals

640
00:42:50,679 --> 00:42:53,440
have actively answered the Belt and Road Initiative,

641
00:42:54,159 --> 00:42:57,119
venturing into Africa to pursue grand visions.

642
00:42:58,440 --> 00:43:01,519
To safeguard Chinese citizens' overseas interests,

643
00:43:01,920 --> 00:43:05,280
Zhong'an Group and an overseas security team,

644
00:43:05,280 --> 00:43:06,239
the Silent Protectors,

645
00:43:06,280 --> 00:43:10,920
joined forces in Antilocaris, Africa,

646
00:43:11,079 --> 00:43:14,280
to establish an international security shield.

647
00:43:15,280 --> 00:43:17,960
To build a brighter future,

648
00:43:18,480 --> 00:43:20,119
we will actively cultivate

649
00:43:20,119 --> 00:43:23,440
partnerships with nations along the route,

650
00:43:23,880 --> 00:43:26,679
gathering the Chinese and African people's

651
00:43:26,679 --> 00:43:28,280
wisdom and strength,

652
00:43:28,840 --> 00:43:32,639
ushering in win-win cooperation and

653
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:34,119
a new era of shared development.
